{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a train that runs forever,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the fall of an empire that had boasted of its glory for a long time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the clues of a noble girl who was forgotten and tossed about by history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of it all,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the train arrives at...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FARAWAY TRAIN is an Atmospheric Narrative Adventure Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar, old-fashioned train and are asked to trace the ephemeral life of Empress Roxelana, who led the world into collapse by using an ancient magical </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >device called the &quot;Nebula Astronomical Disc.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the train for clues to uncover the date and location where she used the device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, there will be locked cabin doors that impede your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The date of each turning point in Roxelana's life serves as the key to opening these doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and enter the number representing these dates to unlock each door while unraveling more of the story behind the abandoned Empress and the magical device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the train, the beautiful, vast scenery outside the train windows will continuously change with procedural generation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the unique scenery spreading out endlessly outside; you will never see the same landscape twice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a Free Mode where the player can freely walk around the train, sit in any seat, look out the train window, and read the ePUB file.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All achievements acquired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/232d7f534ef610d2633e5423486d7067af907838.jpg"},{"name":"Historian Graham","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/58d4fed9e26cf0215abbfd453497363514697968.jpg"},{"name":"Thinking about the future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/f16bb5912b47fba9aeacc72523a723bf521c04c9.jpg"},{"name":"The Deposed Empress Roxelana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/f76332ae9780757e8894811e5aa9c05e7d424f86.jpg"},{"name":"Blacksmith Agreo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/5015f1d88748805150801460ea0cacdaa41707de.jpg"},{"name":"The Blacksmith's Betrothed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/411effdf99b2a0b8c5bc7e2a181bf17d5e6d0798.jpg"},{"name":"Escape from the baggage car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/e298ddba868ed802affc29551cc049841c98364d.jpg"},{"name":"Escape from the third-class seating car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/a80214082ab69e57617a4039c13754a429e1d788.jpg"},{"name":"Inquisitor Rey, Knight of the Temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/4856256e4314142b6bbf8fe9e1adfa6d03b3ab90.jpg"},{"name":"Escape from the third-class sleeping car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1601410/6b8fc4538e5329cce955c60dcdc908ef68bb2885.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1601410?t=1769241529","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601410/89abca6e32365b00b8a7010b8b4a7ec46502de41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769241529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601410/778f31f89ddd3dea6e7be7784023e9a04e7698fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769241529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601410/778f31f89ddd3dea6e7be7784023e9a04e7698fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769241529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a train that runs forever,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the fall of an empire that had boasted of its glory for a long time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the clues of a noble girl who was forgotten and tossed about by history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of it all,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the train arrives at...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FARAWAY TRAIN is an Atmospheric Narrative Adventure Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar, old-fashioned train and are asked to trace the ephemeral life of Empress Roxelana, who led the world into collapse by using an ancient magical </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >device called the &quot;Nebula Astronomical Disc.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the train for clues to uncover the date and location where she used the device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, there will be locked cabin doors that impede your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The date of each turning point in Roxelana's life serves as the key to opening these doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and enter the number representing these dates to unlock each door while unraveling more of the story behind the abandoned Empress and the magical device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the train, the beautiful, vast scenery outside the train windows will continuously change with procedural generation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the unique scenery spreading out endlessly outside; you will never see the same landscape twice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also offers a Free Mode where the player can freely walk around the train, sit in any seat, look out the train window, and read the ePUB file.</p>","developers":["Tatamibeya \u7573\u90e8\u5c4b"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601410/9dbad57527a3d0d3dc2624e846f11fad69409c73/header.jpg?t=1769241529","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Tatamibeya Licensed to and published by AMATA Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601410/1894369714/b2844d15da42755d4a3ce3e09779cb24b091b2ee/1751008595/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748997032","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601410/1894369714/b2844d15da42755d4a3ce3e09779cb24b091b2ee/1751008595/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748997032","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1601410/1894369714/b2844d15da42755d4a3ce3e09779cb24b091b2ee/1751008595/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748997032","id":257148339,"name":"FARAWAY TRAIN Trailer_v2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148339/16ce53115690e69c19ee2447f2da8500b061ef17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748997032"}],"name":"FARAWAY TRAIN","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u6700\u6daf\uff08\u30